      "title": "New snapshot write has no covering test",
      "description": "The change adds a file write and an async return to onSave. No test in the repository exercises onSave. Regressions in the save path, like the broken caller above, reach production unnoticed. Add a test that calls dispatch with the save action and checks both the response and the snapshot file.",
      "suggested_change": null,
